Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.62,0:00:03.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 可以適可而止了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.32,0:00:06.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼要為保護這種東西而去戰鬥呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.05,0:00:24.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Gottfried 2號中彈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.02,0:00:25.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,突圍！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.18,0:00:27.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Kolintos發射！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.43,0:00:34.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Barrel Roll
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.39,0:00:35.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Valiant瞄準
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.13,0:00:42.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.58,0:00:46.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Tristan 1號 2號中彈！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.35,0:00:48.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,兩側Launcher無法發射
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.36,0:00:50.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.71,0:00:54.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,古拉迪斯艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.99,0:01:02.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,主推進器受損 無法維持軌跡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.55,0:03:05.05,Title SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}{\blur3}被選擇的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.07,0:03:04.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Requiem發射方向 有奧布軍MS
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.04,0:03:07.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Station Two馬上到達預定位置
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.57,0:03:11.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,消滅發射方向的奧布軍 Neo-Genesis 瞄準
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.11,0:03:13.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Legend和Destiny呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.80,0:03:15.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,兩者均失去信號
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.59,0:03:18.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Green18 Beat2處 是Freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.39,0:03:22.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,難道說 雷也被他擊落了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.98,0:03:26.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.13,0:03:27.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Meteor！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.22,0:03:28.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.53,0:03:30.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我去攻擊要塞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.90,0:03:31.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,永恆號退下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.62,0:03:35.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真是棘手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.61,0:03:39.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲·克萊茵 基拉·大和
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.97,0:03:42.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.85,0:03:44.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,等下再對付他們
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.60,0:03:49.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,右舵13 下舵8 Neo-Genesis發射軸固定
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.70,0:03:51.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,輸出功率為90%
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.74,0:03:53.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在掃清發射方向的敵軍後
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.72,0:03:55.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,攻擊奧布來結束此次戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.43,0:03:57.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,向全軍傳達！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.98,0:03:58.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.55,0:04:01.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,永恆號！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.18,0:04:03.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,伊紮克·玖爾
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.33,0:04:04.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Messiah要發射了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.93,0:04:07.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓發射軸區域的部隊撤退 快點！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:14.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 瑪琉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.05,0:04:15.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上校！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.65,0:04:18.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,最大馬力 回避！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.12,0:04:28.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Albase和Puraton…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.04,0:04:30.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,吉伯特 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.55,0:04:36.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Requiem進入倒數計時 T-30秒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.47,0:04:39.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Station Two折射角度固定
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.62,0:04:40.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,電子防護屏障 展開
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.86,0:05:08.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真！ 真！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.52,0:05:11.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.09,0:05:16.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:20.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能來這種地方
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.13,0:05:24.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的 只是來這看你一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.70,0:05:26.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只是一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.54,0:05:28.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只是一下嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.27,0:05:30.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 現在是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.44,0:05:32.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.04,0:05:34.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 明天見
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.65,0:05:36.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明天？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.80,0:05:38.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 明天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.44,0:05:42.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉得到了昨天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.37,0:05:52.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我知道 到底是哪個 明天 我很高興
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.72,0:05:57.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 真 明天見
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.45,0:05:59.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.15,0:06:02.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明天見 明天
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:05.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.42,0:06:16.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能 怎麼會…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.34,0:06:31.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.17,0:06:32.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.48,0:06:33.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.72,0:06:37.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.84,0:06:40.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真…真是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.43,0:06:43.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.95,0:06:46.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是Requiem
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.49,0:06:50.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布沒受攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.36,0:07:04.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,防護屏消失 Freedom來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.78,0:07:05.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,其後方是永恆號
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.16,0:07:23.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.45,0:07:43.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長 Messiah…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.59,0:07:46.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本艦的戰鬥結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.81,0:07:47.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全員離艦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.62,0:07:49.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.73,0:07:51.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,古拉迪斯艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.82,0:07:55.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種時候很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:57.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,之後能拜託你嗎？ 亞瑟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.07,0:07:58.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.18,0:08:00.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我必須去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:02.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.08,0:08:07.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過大家就拜託你了 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.65,0:08:10.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.76,0:08:32.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你會來這裏… 老實說真是沒想到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.64,0:08:34.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉·大和
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.32,0:08:44.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此 不過真的好嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.87,0:08:46.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣子真的好嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.66,0:08:53.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,住手吧 好不容易來這到這裏
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.83,0:08:56.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果那麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.36,0:09:00.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,世界只會重新回到混亂的黑暗中去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.90,0:09:04.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我說的可是實話
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.74,0:09:09.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.83,0:09:12.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,或許真是那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.10,0:09:17.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 我們也可以選擇不會造成那種結果的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.12,0:09:19.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過世界還允許這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.56,0:09:23.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過誰都不會選
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.81,0:09:27.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,人們會遺忘 然後再重演
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.18,0:09:30.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不會再這麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.92,0:09:32.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不會造成這樣的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.23,0:09:34.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底有誰能保證呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.30,0:09:37.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰都沒法保證
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.78,0:09:39.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.37,0:09:41.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當然她也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.58,0:09:45.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為你們什麼都不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.16,0:09:53.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡…基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.32,0:09:57.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,吉爾…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.74,0:09:59.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 我們知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.46,0:10:01.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼是能夠瞭解的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.98,0:10:03.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼又是能夠改變的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.91,0:10:08.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以這生命是你 不是他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.12,0:10:10.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才嚮往明天
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.31,0:10:12.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,再怎麼痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.95,0:10:14.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一成不變的世界我們不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.98,0:10:16.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真傲慢呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.50,0:10:19.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是最強的調整者
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.48,0:10:21.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,傲慢的是你才對
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.49,0:10:25.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是一個普通人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.24,0:10:27.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和大家沒什麼兩樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.35,0:10:28.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲也是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.89,0:10:32.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 正因如此才必須朝你開槍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.28,0:10:34.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這你知道嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.85,0:10:40.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你說的世界和我想展示的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:43.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家期盼的到底是哪個？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.78,0:10:45.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在此朝我開槍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.75,0:10:47.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,然後如果又造成混亂的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.88,0:10:49.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你會怎麼辦？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.77,0:10:52.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我有心理準備
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.79,0:10:56.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我會戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.51,0:11:00.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.65,0:11:28.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.25,0:11:32.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.40,0:11:34.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.56,0:11:50.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,呀 泰莉雅 開槍的是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.44,0:11:53.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 是雷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.89,0:11:55.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,吉爾
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.25,0:11:59.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.91,0:12:04.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…他…未來…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.47,0:12:07.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.39,0:12:20.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,古拉迪斯艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.42,0:12:22.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.61,0:12:27.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這個人的靈魂由我來帶走
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.05,0:12:35.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,給拉米亞斯艦長傳句話
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.34,0:12:40.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我有個孩子 是個男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.30,0:12:43.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,找個時候去見見他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.57,0:12:47.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.69,0:13:03.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷 你也過來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.03,0:13:15.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉了 塔莉雅
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.97,0:13:19.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過我很高興
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.13,0:13:21.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真讓人沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.23,0:13:24.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 真的是沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.55,0:13:29.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這難道不正是命運嗎？ 你和我…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.53,0:13:32.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.23,0:13:40.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你…做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.53,0:13:45.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以夠了 已經夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.06,0:13:59.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉君他們呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.57,0:14:12.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.19,0:14:55.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Justice Freedom信號確認 Yellow8 Delta
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.43,0:15:13.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,打開和Gondwana的通訊回路
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.20,0:15:14.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.57,0:15:18.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裏是永恆號的拉克絲·克萊茵
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.99,0:15:21.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,向ZAFT軍現任最高司令官傳達
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.19,0:15:27.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我方認為在這區域繼續戰鬥已經毫無意義
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.21,0:15:29.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也不希望如此
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.40,0:15:34.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請雙方即刻停止所有戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.24,0:15:36.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,重複一次
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.06,0:15:40.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我方認為在這區域繼續戰鬥已經毫無意義…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.86,0:16:17.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要的 真的是那種世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.41,0:16:19.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,與力量嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.82,0:16:21.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快想起來 真！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.34,0:16:24.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你真正…想要的是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.87,0:16:28.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.33,0:17:30.71,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}C.E.74 PLANT和奧布聯合首長國停戰
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.41,0:17:35.00,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}進入停戰議程
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.30,0:17:41.26,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}居間調停的的拉克絲·克萊茵
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.05,0:17:45.18,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}接受PLANT評議會的邀請
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.80,0:17:49.06,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}回到了PLANT
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.70,0:18:12.16,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}奧布領土 淤能碁呂島
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.01,0:18:16.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼說 沒有墓碑？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.61,0:18:20.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 只有慰靈碑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.93,0:18:49.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一直都很討厭這裏
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.55,0:18:53.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是又很牽掛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.24,0:19:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不像現在這樣 也不是這裏
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.72,0:19:03.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,或許無法蒙混過去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.24,0:19:05.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無論花開的多漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.86,0:19:08.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,人總會將其摧毀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.26,0:19:10.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 我不希望
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.11,0:19:14.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我不希望這樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.03,0:19:15.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.74,0:19:39.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.59,0:19:51.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你也來了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.13,0:19:53.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.43,0:20:08.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.66,0:20:11.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.50,0:20:16.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉·大和 Freedom的駕駛員
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.44,0:20:40.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不行嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.11,0:21:02.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.67,0:21:07.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.04,0:21:09.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果再被摧毀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.48,0:21:12.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就由我們再度種植吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.88,0:21:14.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一定…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.60,0:21:28.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是我們的戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.33,0:21:31.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一起戰鬥吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.57,0:21:40.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
